OL,3,GNEWSALost village remembered in 15-year
OL,4,Alabour of love
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lost Cornish village that disappeared
OL,7,Fbeneath expanding china clay workings
OL,8,Fmore than 60 years ago has been brought
OL,9,Fback to life in a new book written by
OL,10,Fone of its former residents.
OL,12,FRetew, near St Austell, was once home
OL,13,Fto about 80 people living in 24 houses
OL,14,Falongside a factory.
OL,16,FThe hamlet between St Stephen and St
OL,17,FDennis was owned by English China Clays
OL,18,Fand was demolished in the early 1960s
OL,19,Fas the company expanded quarry
OL,20,Foperations at Wheal Remfry to extract
OL,21,Fthe valuable clay beneath it.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
